  <summary>Light music player with a MusicBee-style layout and live radio titles</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>Ruche browses your library by genre, artist and album, plays gapless through libmpv,
